d if it satisfies <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/random_access_range\"><code>random_access_range</code></a>. <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::ranges::view_interface&lt;D&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Deduction_guides\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/zip_transform_view/deduction_guides\">Deduction guides</a></h3>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code><i>InnerView</i></code> <span class=\"t-mark\">(private)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/zip_view\"><span class=\"kw3712\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">zip_view</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Views...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>.<br><span class=\"t-mark t-mark-expos\">(<span>exposition-only member type*</span>)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code><i>ziperator</i></code> <span class=\"t-mark\">(private)</span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iterator_t\"><span class=\"kw2908\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> InnerView<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Const</span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, otherwise\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iterator_t\"><span class=\"kw2908\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>InnerView<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>.<br><span class=\"t-mark t-mark-expos\">(<span>exposition-only member type*</span>)</span>\n</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"